      "sha": "8cd4a56e56e499a08827d19a4a12874b5d168ee5",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/Anastasia-Labs/midgard/commit/8cd4a56e56e499a08827d19a4a12874b5d168ee5",
      "message": "Keep discovery completion controls compatible with ES2022\n\nUse a one-shot Node event for the native read completion observable. The repository typecheck targets ES2022, which does not declare Promise.withResolvers. Preserve the physical-join assertion and cleanup without changing runtime code or compiler settings.",
      "authorName": "Philip DiSarro",
      "authorDate": "2026-10-07T05:46:01Z"
    },
    {
      "sha": "853d7b9ac785680b608bdf511a003f4ef8e7b7a9",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/Anastasia-Labs/midgard/commit/853d7b9ac785680b608bdf511a003f4ef8e7b7a9",
      "message": "Authenticate availability discovery across forward chain progress (#681)\n\nReplace discovery-wide tip equality in both responder runtimes with a durable native forward interval and selected-input rechecks. Preserve generation, provider alignment, scope ownership and pre-submission authority refusals. Refs #681.",
      "authorName": "Philip DiSarro",
      "authorDate": "2026-10-07T05:32:21Z"
    },
    {
      "sha": "1d6471f5d5e6891ba5e650b599a38a28e16e36fa",
