    },
    {
      "sha": "a270ba04db587ea5b1f637a3eaf27de2b6d20200",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/Anastasia-Labs/midgard/commit/a270ba04db587ea5b1f637a3eaf27de2b6d20200",
      "message": "Fund standalone correction locks for their Locked datum (#648)\n\nShare the parameter-derived worst-case reserve with atomic initialization so correction creation can preserve value through Idle to Locked. Exercise both public creators and causal insufficient-funding controls against the real validator.",
